{"id":"8dfa83196961379b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3Grid.md","title":"L3Grid","display":"L3Grid","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3Grid","parameters":["g","a","P","V"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3Grid"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span><span>P</span><span>V</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>P</code>、<code>V</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3Grid g a P V)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ L3FiniteInput g a)\n  (and (@ L3Atoms g a P) (and (@ Finite P) (exists three (and (@ Num3 three) (@ Space P three V))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee0b315916cb8bff\" href=\"?note=ee0b315916cb8bff\" title=\"ZFC_Finite\">Finite</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b475d7d49a565a3e\" href=\"?note=b475d7d49a565a3e\" title=\"ZFC_L3Atoms\">L3Atoms</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e56e1132597c40e3\" href=\"?note=e56e1132597c40e3\" title=\"ZFC_L3FiniteInput\">L3FiniteInput</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"328ced6f64afa4d9\" href=\"?note=328ced6f64afa4d9\" title=\"ZFC_Num3\">Num3</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0d262c1cdcf87048\" href=\"?note=0d262c1cdcf87048\" title=\"ZFC_Space\">Space</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 